From: QC3284 <2078725082@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 11:51:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 21/22] MAINTAINERS: add the ZTE ZXHN E2631 board and the
 ZX279128S drivers

Cover the board directory, the SoC support code, the Ethernet, MDIO and
SPI drivers, the defconfig, the device tree and the command docs, so that
get_maintainer can route patches for this out-of-tree port.

Signed-off-by: QC3284 <2078725082@qq.com>
---
 MAINTAINERS | 14 ++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+)

diff --git a/MAINTAINERS b/MAINTAINERS
index 6edf740a..dc85489d 100644
--- a/MAINTAINERS
+++ b/MAINTAINERS
@@ -1916,6 +1916,20 @@ S:	Maintained
 F:	cmd/xxd.c
 F:	doc/usage/cmd/xxd.rst
 
+ZTE ZXHN E2631 (SANECHIPS ZX279128S)
+M:	QC3284 <2078725082@qq.com>
+S:	Maintained
+F:	arch/arm/dts/zx279128s-zte-zxhn-e2631.dts
+F:	arch/arm/mach-zx279128s/
+F:	board/zte/zxhn-e2631/
+F:	configs/zx279128s_zte_zxhn-e2631_defconfig
+F:	doc/usage/cmd/e2631*.rst
+F:	drivers/net/zx279128s_eth.c
+F:	drivers/net/zx279128s_eth.h
+F:	drivers/net/zx279128s_mdio.c
+F:	drivers/spi/spi-zx.c
+F:	include/configs/zx279128s_zte_zxhn-e2631.h
+
 THE REST
 M:	Tom Rini <trini@konsulko.com>
